# Project Structure Guide

- **Entry points**: `index.html`, `index.tsx`
- **App shell**: `src/App.tsx`
- **UI components**: `src/components/**`
- **Feature workspaces**: `src/components/{request,response,bulk,flow,discovery}`
- **Contexts**: `src/context/**`
- **Hooks**: `src/hooks/**`
- **Utilities**: `src/utils/**`
- **Styles**: `src/styles/index.css`
- **API boundary**: `src/api/index.ts`
- **Types**: `src/types.ts`
- **Build config**: `vite.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`

Start from [`index.tsx`](mdc:index.tsx) which renders [`src/App.tsx`](mdc:src/App.tsx).
Key feature views include [`components/request/RequestComposer`](mdc:src/components/request/RequestComposer.tsx)
and [`components/response/ResponsePanel`](mdc:src/components/response/ResponsePanel.tsx).
Shared state providers live in [`src/context`](mdc:src/context/). Reusable UI primitives are under
[`src/components/ui`](mdc:src/components/ui/).

